							Ok you dumbfuck crybaby son of a bitch... lets get one thing straight... Mazzar and rest of chillin crew cleared past the see invs giants well before you and your raid did. Now in all honesty, they asked me to come help and ssnakess said that it seemed that adventure company was trying to race for it. Vindi is a piece of shit mob that I can care less about so I told ssnakess fuck all that racing shit, let them have it. I mean only reason we are killing it is for fucking lvl 30 twinks.<br /><br />But I come anyways because Mazz claimed you all hadnt even made it near arena yet. I get there and Ssnakess has vindi and his two guards argo and is kiting them around to prepare for the split. Then you or someone from your guild proceeds to have a /ooc shit war with Ssnakess... notice I didnt say shit... &nbsp;I split the first guard off and kill it, then Mazzars charmed pet fucks shit up a little and makes us pretty much wipe (minor mistake no big deal). So you all move in and get your chance and proceed to wipe as well.<br /><br />Now the fucked up thing is Slaeny sends me a tell asking me for consent saying she would res. Mind you, i wasnt part of the shit talking or the /ooc arguement. So I give her consent and the fucking bitch drops my corpse near statue area. ( you can tell me all you want you fucking cock sucker that it wasnt part of your guild but we all werent born yesterday, only person with a motive to do some shit like that would be someone all butt hurt because someone was killing their vindi) But ok no sweat we get the corpses and res back in. Did lanquay train you all? (btw lanquay is my fucking twink cleric) ya he did to some extent, but wasnt a good one. I should of been a real dick and grabbed every fucking mob in the zone and dumped it on your ass. But I am sure there is a few good seeds in your guild, so glad i didnt. <br /><br />And FYI you dipshit, we could of killed vindi but ssnakess talked to one of your guild peeps and told them that we would give you all one more shot at killing it. So you can fucking shut the fuck up and stop crying because believe me we could of been real dicks and paraded around with a lvl 30 twink with his new vindi bp infront of your lame ass.<br />
