							You little faggot, I learned your a bitch ass little pussy who gets all pist off because he doesnt get his way. Fuck you asshole, your mom should of taught you some fucking lessons growing up... you dont always get your way.<br /><br />You can wish whatever you want about my guild, it doesnt have shit to do with ascent, because anyone else in any other guild would of done the same. You think because you zone into kael and say we are taking vindi, thats word... no you fucking moron... you have to engage it first to lay claim to it. But oops I forgot.. you probably I havent been anywhere near the high end game to know shit like this. <br /><br />And we did let you have it. I sat there full buffed, rdy to go, as vindi ran past me. I could of easly tagged it. We could of easly pulled it 3 minutes before you even pulled it. Really I cant believe I am arguing over a lame fucking ass mob like Vindi thats god damn 4 expansions old. I mean we kill it with less then 1 grp.. its just bullshit for us. But you are a dumbass and I will be sure to look for you in game so I can laugh at your lame ass. Unless your a pussy and posted under a different name then your real character name.
