							LOL Have problems finding corpse?? are you nuts?? I have a corpse finder in bank AND on Kara.. Ssna has one.. now you really think we have a problem?.. we was rezzed and buffed b4 you got to pull.... ohh and Garadan has a necro IF is really got bad... and I agree with what Garadan said.. we was clearing.. INFACT I was clearing all see invis mobs and more.. had 5 on me when Mazz and mamael showed.. and ONLY 1 person ran by us... then ran back by us because she was agro to a mob.. so clearly I was a head of you all.. but again.. like gara said.. not like he wont be up again.. and we will take the team in there again.... But just because you have a &quot;hard on&quot; for Ascent dont mean for you to come here and start bs .. Ssna was in tells with someone from your guild. Seems like I got tells from the NICE ones in your guild.. saying sorry etc.. (this is a shm with only 2 hours sleep in 2 days.. so dont ruffle my feathers) But you enjoy your laugh and that.. =) For I am!
