								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=535.msg4087#msg4087"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=535.msg4087#msg4087">Re:Ascent -&gt; ssnakess, karadana, mamael, other asshole names I forget</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #13 on:</b> December 27, 2003, 05:11:32 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Now I kinda regret clickin people in from your guild after you wiped and mgb&#039;n virtue after he was dead. Way I understood it Mazzar was at Vindi after we finished raiding for the night in the guild. When I zoned in OA started zoneing in; me and Karadana cleared the right side before the entire OA raid could clear the left. Mazzar and &quot;the chillins&quot; thought that they were doing like Kael Faction grinds or whatever. I personally didnt think they were there for Vindi(till Ssnakess started to pull him). We had a glich with Mazzar&#039;s pet(still dont know why he had one) and it came with Vindi the rest of the arena that was up. We managed to kill most of that and one of Vindi&#039;s guards before Garadan died. After that Vindi summoned me but I had 3 Da&#039;s up so was able to zone without much of a problem. Came back rezed them and Garadan said OA wiped on Vindi so we searched for corpses and I helped their CR. <br />Told the group theres no point in fighting for a 8 hour spawn mob, then we rebuffed killed a few repops and Ssnakess said that he talked to one of their leaders and was going to let them have another shot and if they wiped we would take it and if they win who cares. We could have pulled the mob a at least 10 times before they pulled it the second time and won. <br />After they won I went over and helped rez some of their members, MGB&#039;d Hand of Virtue, talked to a few members in there guild &quot;about sorry for the shit etc&quot;, and then gated. I will tell ya this tho I am an Asshole and any OA member that ask me for help on anything or a buff or a rez anywhere will get a quick no! I will go one step futher and say anyone that considers themself a friend of mine will take this same philosophy and it will be much appreciated. 
						</td>
