								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=355"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=535.msg4089#msg4089"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=535.msg4089#msg4089">Re:Ascent -&gt; ssnakess, karadana, mamael, other asshole names I forget</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #14 on:</b> December 27, 2003, 05:43:35 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							If you see more than 4 ascent in the zone and there is a red /con named mob up, they are there to TAKE IT DOWN.<br /><br />If you are there to also try to take it down, then, make sure you say something, cause, the nice ppl from Ascent are bored, and they were going to take it down for fun, and, probably on their way to do something much harder.<br />And, they&#039;re probably pretty tired, and didnt get much sleep and probably pretty cranky too. And they dont usually think to &nbsp;/ who the zone.<br />If you&#039;re after a tough mob, and some Ascent show up in the zone, they stopped by to kill it cause, they like to kill tough stuff that repops. If you dont say something and mention you&#039;re there, you risk losing your mark.<br /><br />Let me put it this way. Ascent is the high end ROAMER mob in the game. We kill NPC&#039;s. Sometimes we kill HARD ones, sometimes we kill not so hard ones. We kill stuff for good loot, we kill stuff just because it&#039;s hard. Alot of times we go kill something just because it&#039;s tough and it&#039;s there and all the loot rots cause it&#039;s lore and we already have it.<br /> Want some advice? if you see 4 Ascent in the zone and something worth killing is still alive, be cool and SAY SOMETHING COOL. The nice thing about Ascent is that it&#039;s a guild of people that aren&#039;t losers. If you were trying to accomplish something, they not only would give you a shot trying, they would probably give a hand.<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
